{51}{My, you have traveled far.  It is good to meet a fellow adventurer.  I fear we are becoming a rare breed.  Too many prefer the comforts of familiar places and large cities to the freedom of the open wilderness.  Allow me to introduce myself, I am Kietzel Pierce.}{My, you have traveled far.  It is good to meet a fellow adventurer.  I fear we are becoming a rare breed.  Too many prefer the comforts of familiar places and large cities to the freedom of the open wilderness.  Allow me to introduce myself, I am Kietzel Pierce.}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
